{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671294075379763465","title":"硬件测试工程师","description":"1.负责小米产品和业务的硬件测试开发及验证工作；\r\n2.搭建测试平台，制定.完善和优化测试方案以满足产品标准和质量需求，输出测试报告；\r\n3.开发或选取合理的测试设备与系统，以实施测试方案，分析并提出优化改善建议；\r\n4.协助建设内部试验室测试能力；\r\n5.外部测试试验室资源的选择和管理。","requirement":"1.本科及以上学历，通信电子.无线电技术.电气工程.机电一体化.自动化等相关专业；\r\n2.熟悉某一硬件领域（基带.射频.辐射.结构可靠性.硬件产品等）的设计原理以及测试方法；\r\n3.结果导向.自我驱动，具备良好的自学能力；\r\n4.具有良好的沟通能力.团队协作意愿和能力；\r\n5.英语六级水平，具备良好的读写能力；\r\n6.熟练使用office等办公软件。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786112505091,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7467761529010634860","name":"测试类","en_name":"Testing","i18n_name":"测试类"},"job_id":"7671294075379616009","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","n